 <h3><u>Maula Haq Imam</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya Husain ya husain..(4)<br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain.. husain..(2)</p> 
  <p>haye haal likhu kya saadaat ke lutne ka<br> mai khud ek sayyed zaada hu<br> mujhe khoon rulate hai aksar<br> kabhi maqtal, kabhi koofa, kabhi shaam</p> 
  <p>maula haq imam..(4)<br> maula haq imam ya hasan ya husain<br> ya husain ya husain ya husain</p> 
  <p>1. Baade husain ibn e ali<br> zainab pe kya aayi ghadi<br> jalti hui reti pe thi<br> be aasra aale nabi<br> shame ghariba aagayi, har su udasi chaa gai<br> pehre pe zainab aagayi..(2)<br> aur lab pe tha bus ye kalaam</p> 
  <p>2. Maqdooma e kaunain ki poti sakina bekhata<br> baba ka laasha dhundhne phirti thi ban me ja baja<br> shabbir ki wo laadli, seene pe jo shah ke pali<br> uski yahi faryaad thi..(2)<br> jab jal chuke saare khayaam</p> 
  <p>3. Jis ke lahu ka aaj bhi maqrooz hai saara jaha<br> halmin ki jo aawaz par maqtal me aaya bezaba<br> wo asghar e besheer tha jo kaatibe taqdeer tha<br> haye hurmala ka teer tha..(2)<br> jis ke liye mehwe kalaam</p> 
  <p>4. Haye haye mohammad ka chaman kuch is tarah loota gaya<br> ye bekasi saadaat ki ke barsare karbobala<br> rokar kahe qasim ki maa, maara gaya qasim jawa<br> zinda rahe kaise ye maa..(2)<br> faryaad ya shahe anaam</p> 
  <p>5. Mashko alam lekar chala mashko alam ka paasba<br> mashke sakina jab chidi pani baha baade azaa<br> abbas ke baazu kate, dil kaap utha ye sochke<br> wo khaak par kaise gire..(2)<br> kehte hue tum par salaam</p> 
  <p>6. Tere akhee mazloom ka ghar se janaza jab chala<br> taboot par 100 teer the lekin shahe karbobala<br> teero pe tha laasha tera, maa sayyeda mehwo buka<br> kehne lagi karbobala..(2)<br> zinda rahe dono ka naam</p> 
  <p>7. 11 moharram aa gayi aale nabi ka karwaa<br> tha shaam ki janib rawa aur kafile ka sarbaa<br> wo abide bimaar tha chalne se jo laachar th<br> mehve buka ghum khwar tha..(2)<br> kehta chala har ek gaam</p> 
  <p>8. Kaafi hai rone ke liye wo shaam o kufa ka safar<br> chadar talab karta raha sajjad qaidi nauhagar<br> fir qaidiyo ka qafila darbaar me laaya gaya<br> khudba jo zainab ne diya..(2)<br> Lab Per Tha Yeh&nbsp; Nauha Madham</p> 
  <p>9. Irfan o mazhar&nbsp; abidi karte raho har dum ye bain<br> bus zindagi bhar ya hasan, bus zindagi bhar ya husain<br> nauhe ka yu haq ho ada, jab barsare farshe aza<br> nauha padhe khud sayyeda..(2)<br> rokar kahe sab khaso aam</p> 
